    "en": "KM1 forward, KM2 reverse (L1/L3 swapped), interlocked. KM1 or KM2 contacts 33–34 (in parallel) feed KT1 and the star/delta circuit: KT1 15–16 → KM4.41–42 → KM3 (star); KT1 15–18 → KM3.41–42 → KM4 (delta)."
  },
